+### `deadline-hits-per-handler-hour`
+
+**Question:** how many statements hit their deadline per app, handler and UTC hour?
+Returns `hour`, `app_id`, `handler_kind`, `name`, `path` and `deadline_hits`.
+Joins deadline-tagged `sql_events` to the nearest completing request by trace, app
+and request time window (one match per SQL event, including millisecond timestamp rounding).
+Parameters: `since`, `until`, `appId` (all optional). Failed statements are logged even
+without `TRACE_SQL`; execution paths in older JSONL are NULL. Ingest adds the nullable
+`path` column to existing v2 event logs.
+
